  ('punjabi-samosa', 5, 'Cook in batches, turning once, until crisp outside and fully cooked in the centre.'),
  ('punjabi-samosa', 6, 'Drain briefly and serve hot with chutney or lemon.'),
  ('chilli-paneer', 1, 'Slice the main ingredient and vegetables into even pieces; mix the soy sauce with a spoonful of water.'),
